# Leaks that are inside a library and reproduce without any of our code.
#
# libx265 3.5: x265_encoder_open() keeps memory that x265_encoder_close()
# does not give back: 1.2 kB with most presets, about 5 kB with
# "ultrafast". A program that only opens and closes the encoder shows it.
# One lot per encoder opened, so it does not grow while a channel runs.
leak:x265_encoder_open
